------------+-------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------
 table_rows | public.docs | row hash <hash>: 0 row(s) in the table, 1 entry(ies) in the ledger
 table_rows | public.docs | row hash <hash>: 1 row(s) in the table, 0 entry(ies) in the ledger
(2 rows)

:trig_off;
\c
SET search_path = public;
SET kingres_ledger.allow_manual_write = on;
SELECT public.restore_all();
 restore_all 
